Khi đó, ta có $|\overrightarrow{MD}|=MD=\sqrt{BD^2+BM^2} = \sqrt{(a\sqrt{2})^2 + \left(\dfrac{a\sqrt{2}}{2}\right)^2} = \dfrac{a\sqrt{10}}{2}$.

