Mặt khác
$$
\dfrac{MA'}{MA}=\dfrac{S_{MA'B}}{S_{MAB}}=\dfrac{S_{MA'C}}{S_{MAC}}=\dfrac{S_{MA'B} + S_{MA'C}}{S_{MAB} + S_{MAC}}=\dfrac{S_a}{S_b + S_c} \Rightarrow \overrightarrow{MA'}=\dfrac{-S_a}{S_b + S_c} \overrightarrow{MA}. \qquad(2)
$$
Thay $(2)$ vào $(1)$ ta được
$$
-S_a \overrightarrow{MA}=S_b \overrightarrow{MB} + S_c \overrightarrow{MC}\Leftrightarrow S_a \overrightarrow{MA} + S_b \overrightarrow{MB} + S_c \overrightarrow{MC}= \overrightarrow{0}.
$$

