# Đề bài

Cho tam giác $ABC$, lấy điểm $M$, $N$, $P$ sao cho $\overrightarrow{MB}=3\overrightarrow{MC}$, $\overrightarrow{NA}+3\overrightarrow{NC}=\overrightarrow{0}$, $\overrightarrow{PA}+\overrightarrow{PB}=\overrightarrow{0}$. Phân tích $\overrightarrow{PM}$, $\overrightarrow{PN}$ theo $\overrightarrow{AB}$, $\overrightarrow{AC}$.

# Lời giải

Từ $\overrightarrow{PA}+\overrightarrow{PB}=\overrightarrow{0} \Rightarrow P$ là trung điểm $AB$ $\Rightarrow \overrightarrow{AP} = \dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AB}$.
Từ $\overrightarrow{NA}+3\overrightarrow{NC}=\overrightarrow{0} \Rightarrow \overrightarrow{AN} = \dfrac{3}{4}\overrightarrow{AC}$.
Từ $\overrightarrow{MB}=3\overrightarrow{MC} \Rightarrow \overrightarrow{AM} = \dfrac{\overrightarrow{AB} - 3\overrightarrow{AC}}{1 - 3} = -\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AB} + \dfrac{3}{2}\overrightarrow{AC}$.
Do đó:
$$
\overrightarrow{PM} = \overrightarrow{AM} - \overrightarrow{AP} = \left(-\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AB} + \dfrac{3}{2}\overrightarrow{AC}\right) - \dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AB} = \dfrac{3}{2}\overrightarrow{AC} - \overrightarrow{AB}.
$$
$$
\overrightarrow{PN} = \overrightarrow{AN} - \overrightarrow{AP} = \dfrac{3}{4}\overrightarrow{AC} - \dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AB}.
$$

