b) Ta có
$$
\overrightarrow{AK} = \overrightarrow{AI}+\overrightarrow{IK}=\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AC}+\dfrac{2}{3}\overrightarrow{IH} = \dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AC}+\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{AB}
$$
(do $IH$ là đường trung bình trong $\triangle ABC$).

Lại có
$$
\overrightarrow{AL} = \overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{BL}=\overrightarrow{AB}+\dfrac{3}{5}\overrightarrow{BC} = \dfrac{2}{5}\overrightarrow{AB}+\dfrac{3}{5}\overrightarrow{AC}=\dfrac{6}{5}\left(\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{AB}+\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{AC}\right)=\dfrac{6}{5}\overrightarrow{AK}.
$$
Vậy ba điểm $A$, $K$, $L$ thẳng hàng.

