\overrightarrow{AC}+\overrightarrow{BD}=\left(\overrightarrow{AB}+ \overrightarrow{BC}\right)+\left(\overrightarrow{BC}+\overrightarrow{CD}\right)=2\overrightarrow{BC}+\left(\overrightarrow{AB}+\overrightarrow{CD}\right)=2\overrightarrow{BC}+\overrightarrow{0}=2\overrightarrow{BC}.
$$

