B. $\overrightarrow{BI}=\overrightarrow{a}+\overrightarrow{b}$

C. $\overrightarrow{BI}=-\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{a}+\overrightarrow{b}$

D. $\overrightarrow{BI}=\dfrac{1}{2}\overrightarrow{a}+\overrightarrow{b}$

