A. $\overrightarrow{AO}=\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{a}+\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{b}$

B. $\overrightarrow{AO}=\dfrac{1}{6}\overrightarrow{a}+\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{b}$

C. $\overrightarrow{AO}=\dfrac{1}{3}\overrightarrow{a}+2\overrightarrow{b}$

