A. $\overrightarrow{AK} = -\dfrac{3}{8}\overrightarrow{AB} + \dfrac{1}{12}\overrightarrow{AC}$

B. $\overrightarrow{AK} = -\dfrac{3}{8}\overrightarrow{AB} - \dfrac{1}{12}\overrightarrow{AC}$

